# Database: use either DATABASE_URL (single URL) or all PG* variables.
# Copy from Replit Secrets or your Neon/Supabase dashboard when running locally
# with a remote database. See docs/running-locally-with-remote-db.md

# Option A – single URL (e.g. from Neon or Replit if they provide one)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:port/database

# Option B – individual vars
# PGHOST=your-db-host
# PGPORT=5432
# PGDATABASE=your_database
# PGUSER=your_user
# PGPASSWORD=your_password
